 is to  somehow revive that peace deal from 2019  to do that the president the former  president and all their allies need to  come together  but that won't be easy in a country with  a lot of players  and too many guns  al jazeera is always monitoring what's  happening in car so check our website  for the latest and youtube for reports  from our correspondents on the ground  i'll see you next week


